 docs/specs/software-requirements/srd050-readlink.yaml (full SRD for readlink)\n      - cmd/readlink/main.go (existing implementation to extend)\n      - cmd/readlink/readlink_test.go (existing differential tests to extend)\n      - pkg/testutils/ (differential testing pattern)\n\n    files:\n      - path: cmd/readlink/main.go\n        action: modify\n        note: Implement behavior for srd050-readlink R4.3\n      - path: cmd/readlink/readlink_test.go\n        action: modify\n        note: Add differential test cases for R4.3\n\n    requirements:\n      - id: R1\n        text: Implement srd050-readlink requirement R4.3 per the SRD specification\n\n    design_decisions:\n      - id: D1\n        text: Follow the existing code structure in cmd/readlink/main.go -- extend rather than rewrite\n      - id: D2\n        text: Use testutils.RunDiffTests with reference binary greadlink for differential testing\n      - id: D3\n        text: Call sys.InstallSIGPIPEHandler() at start of main (already present -- do not remove)\n\n    acceptance_criteria:\n      - id: AC1\n        text: R4.3 behavior implemented per the SRD\n      - id: AC2\n        text: Differential test cases added that exercise R4.3\n      - id: AC3\n        text: go build ./cmd/readlink/ succeeds with no errors\n      - id: AC4\n        text: go test ./cmd/readlink/ -count=1 passes (or skips gracefully if greadlink not in PATH)\n\n- index: 1\n  title: \"[stitch] cmd/realpath: features implementation (srd049-realpath R1.1-R1.2, R1.3-R1.4)\"\n  dependency: -1\n  description: |\n    deliverable_type: code\n\n    required_reading:\n      - docs/specs/software-requirements/srd049-realpath.yaml (full SRD for realpath)\n      - pkg/sys/sys.go (InstallSIGPIPEHandler and file metadata)\n      - pkg/testutils/ (differential testing pattern -- RunDiffTests, BuildBinary, DiffTest struct)\n\n    files:\n      - path: cmd/realpath/main.go\n        action: create\n        note: Main implementation of realpath covering R1.1